      </TableHeader>
      <TableBody>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>autoAssignCIDRs</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>array (string)</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>autoAssignCIDRs is a list of CIDRs from which to automatically assign Service.ExternalIP. These are assigned when the service is of type LoadBalancer. In general, this is only useful for bare-metal clusters. In Openshift 3.x, this was misleadingly called "IngressIPs". Automatically assigned External IPs are not affected by any ExternalIPPolicy rules. Currently, only one entry may be provided.</TableCell>
